> ug 2024
. *   007171  McKesson                     San Francisco -> Irving, 1 Apr 2019
. *   012142  Oracle                       Redwood City -> Austin,  Dec 2020
. *   013988  Charles Schwab               San Francisco -> Westlake, 1 Jan 202
> 1
. *   026156  Hewlett Packard Enterprise   San Jose -> Spring (Houston), announ
> ced Dec 2020, campus 2022
. *   147988  AECOM                        Los Angeles -> Dallas,   1 Oct 2021
. *   162876  Core-Mark                    S. San Francisco -> Westlake, 18 May
